<http://localhost:5002/osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-xmqouv> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Research data for: \\'a protracted phenology: post-diapause larval development of a threatened butterfly\\'".
<http://localhost:5002/osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-xmqouv> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Raw data for stasticial analysis like GLMM.".
<http://localhost:5002/osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-xmqouv> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-xmqouv".
<http://localhost:5002/osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-xmqouv> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
