<http://localhost:5002/osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-yxps4g> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.26249%2FFK2%2FYXPS4G>.
<http://localhost:5002/osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-yxps4g> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Dataset for: the more we measure, the less we see: on the replicability and repeatability of mobile starlink measurements".
<http://localhost:5002/osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-yxps4g> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset contains the preprocessed traces of 35 test drives on the highway with two car-roof mounted Starlink dishes with active loss/delay measurements using ICMP. The dataset is described in the paper: The More We Measure, The Less We See: On the Replicability and Repeatability of Mobile Starlink Measurements. In 4th Workshop on LEOIn 4th Workshop on LEO Networking and Communication (LEO-NET ’26), August 17–21, 2026, Denver, CO, USA. ACM, New York, NY, USA, 6 pages. https://doi.org/10.1145/3789240.3827586".
<http://localhost:5002/osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-yxps4g> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-yxps4g".
<http://localhost:5002/osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-yxps4g> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-yxps4g> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> <http://localhost:5002/organization/osnadata>.
<http://localhost:5002/osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-yxps4g> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.26249/FK2/YXPS4G>.
<http://localhost:5002/osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-yxps4g> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/temporal> _:osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-yxps4g.
