<http://localhost:5002/osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-w1izro> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.26249%2FFK2%2FW1IZRO>.
<http://localhost:5002/osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-w1izro> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Distributed lora based co2 monitoring network - a standalone open source system for contagion prevention by controlled ventilation".
<http://localhost:5002/osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-w1izro> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "We here present the .stl files, source code and libraries that supplement the open access article \\'Distributed LoRa based CO2 monitoring network - A standalone open source system for contagion prevention by controlled ventilation\\' (under review).".
<http://localhost:5002/osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-w1izro> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-w1izro".
<http://localhost:5002/osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-w1izro> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2021"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-w1izro> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> <http://localhost:5002/organization/osnadata>.
