<http://localhost:5002/osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-i7bany> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Starframe-udp: starlink frame timings at full utilization".
<http://localhost:5002/osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-i7bany> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset contains the measured Starlink Frames observed during the measurements for the Paper <a href=\\'https://doi.org/10.1145/3748749.3749089 \\'><em>Better Fill Up Your Pipe – Revisiting Starlink\\'s Burst Characterization</em></a>. The original Inter-Packet-Delays can be handed out on request, but are too large to be publicly served.".
