<http://localhost:5002/osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-gjfuon> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This data set contains the source code for the compiler-implemented differential checksums as described in the following publication:  Christoph Borchert, Horst Schirmeier, and Olaf Spinczyk. Compiler-Implemented Differential Checksums: Effective Detection and Correction of Transient and Permanent Memory Errors. In Proceedings of the 53rd IEEE/IFIP International Conference on Dependable Systems and Networks (DSN \\'23). Piscataway, NJ, USA, June 2023. IEEE Press.".
