<http://localhost:5002/osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-5ookn8> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Hierarchical goal system diagram comparison".
<http://localhost:5002/osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-5ookn8> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The data in this set stems from online studies in which students generated hierarchical goals systems (HGS) in two  online studies, and compared four types of visualizations for HGS. The technical setup consisted of a Django web application, publicly available under MIT license at  GitHub: https://github.com/fweber/GoalTrees".
