<http://localhost:5002/osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-asl0bv> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.26249%2FFK2%2FASL0BV>.
<http://localhost:5002/osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-asl0bv> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Ada 2025: a multimodal dataset for water-deficit stress detection in sugar beets - thermal data".
<http://localhost:5002/osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-asl0bv> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This dataset contains the thermal data for the ADA 2025 sugar beet dry stress dataset.".
<http://localhost:5002/osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-asl0bv> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-asl0bv".
<http://localhost:5002/osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-asl0bv> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>.
<http://localhost:5002/osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-asl0bv> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> <http://localhost:5002/organization/osnadata>.
<http://localhost:5002/osn-doi-10-26249-fk2-asl0bv> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://doi.org/10.26249/FK2/ASL0BV>.
